Logos bundled into the web app

The logo files below are copied from dashboard-icons
(https://github.com/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons) at commit
d767d7327db7f8ebd3715b552523f61889eea41c, under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The full license text is LICENSE.dashboard-icons in this folder.

  Copyright (c) 2024 Bjorn Lammers, Meier Lukas, Thomas Camlong and Homarr Labs

The logos and product names are trademarks of their owners. They are shown
only to identify each image in the popular images row and each engine in the
New database form; showing them does not mean the owners endorse this
project.

SVG files are unchanged copies of the upstream svg/<name>.svg. WebP files are
the upstream png/<name>.png resized to 128 px and saved as WebP (the upstream
SVG is missing or embeds a large PNG). RustFS has only a wordmark upstream
and keeps its letter tile.

The template catalog's logos are credited in the catalog itself (the
Templates repository's NOTICE, written to templates/NOTICE for the copy
that ships with the panel).

